cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Bare Metal Development Environment (BMDE) CLI"
abstract: >-
  Command line interface that wraps the Bare Metal Development Environment, a set of Docker images and host tools
  (devkitARM, DeSmuME, Insight, dlditool, grit, git over the URV VPN) for Nintendo DS development, used in the
  practical exercises of the Computers subject at Universitat Rovira i Virgili.
authors:
